# Regression for flaw-and-Add.md A-4 (octal): an octal integer literal that
# exceeds the 64-bit range used to be silently clamped to LLONG_MAX.  After
# the fix it must be a syntax error ("integer literal out of range"), i.e. a
# non-zero exit.
module myon.stdio
c = 0o777777777777777777777777
myon.print(c)
